# Defensive: prior agent sessions dropped non-Harness lottery scripts
# into the repo root. They have been relocated to C:\AI\Lottery-Toolkit\.
# These patterns prevent re-creation from being silently committed.
lottery-*.js
lottery-*.html
lottery-toolkit/
lottery-*/
*-lottery.js
